
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>CampusLoop - Share and Borrow</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>CampusLoop</h1>
        <p>Find what you need. Share what you have.</p>
    </header>

    <hr>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a> |
        <a href="#about">About</a> |
        <a href="#items">Items</a> |
        <a href="#share">Share an Item</a> |
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <hr>

    <main>
        <section id="home">
            <h2>Welcome to CampusLoop</h2>
            <p>Have an item that someone else might need? Or are you looking for something you don't want to buy?</p>
            <p>CampusLoop makes it easier for people to share, lend and borrow useful items.</p>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>What is CampusLoop?</h2>
            <p>CampusLoop is a platform where people can share things they own and find items listed by others.</p>
            <p>You can borrow items for free or rent them at a price decided by the owner.</p>

            <h3>How it works</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Browse the available items.</li>
                <li>Choose something you need.</li>
                <li>Contact the owner.</li>
                <li>Agree on the borrowing or rental details.</li>
                <li>Return the item after use.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section id="items">
            <h2>Items Available</h2>
            <table border="1">
                <tr>
                    <th>Item</th>
                    <th>Category</th>
                    <th>Owner</th>
                    <th>Price</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Scientific Calculator</td>
                    <td>Electronics</td>
                    <td>Arun</td>
                    <td>Free</td>
                    <td>Available</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Engineering Mathematics Book</td>
                    <td>Books</td>
                    <td>Priya</td>
                    <td>₹20/day</td>
                    <td>Available</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Arduino Uno</td>
                    <td>Electronics</td>
                    <td>Rahul</td>
                    <td>₹50/day</td>
                    <td>Available</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Drawing Instruments</td>
                    <td>Stationery</td>
                    <td>Vijay</td>
                    <td>Free</td>
                    <td>Available</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section id="share">
            <h2>List an Item</h2>
            <p>Have something useful to share? Add its details below.</p>

            <form>
                <label for="name">Your Name:</label><br>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required><br><br>

                <label for="email">Email:</label><br>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required><br><br>

                <label for="item">Item Name:</label><br>
                <input type="text" id="item" name="item" required><br><br>

                <label for="category">Category:</label><br>
                <select id="category" name="category">
                    <option>Books</option>
                    <option>Electronics</option>
                    <option>Stationery</option>
                    <option>Sports</option>
                    <option>Other</option>
                </select><br><br>

                <label for="price">Price:</label><br>
                <input type="text" id="price" name="price" placeholder="Free or amount"><br><br>

                <label for="description">Description:</label><br>
                <textarea id="description" name="description" rows="4" cols="30"></textarea><br><br>

                <button type="submit">Submit Item</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>Have a question or suggestion?</p>
            <p>Email: campusloop@example.com</p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <hr>

    <footer>
        <p>CampusLoop | Share more, waste less.</p>
        <p>© 2026 CampusLoop</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
